{"body": [{"y0": 67.8, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.6, "text": "nus can- et ov-. Can- et ov- pàstór- amant. Cibus ov- est"}, {"y0": 81.5, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 348.2, "text": "herba, cibus pastor- est pàn-. Pàstor pàn- ést."}, {"y0": 95.3, "x0": 159.9, "x1": 403.7, "text": "In coll- üna arbor est. Pastor cum can- et ov- ad arbor- it."}, {"y0": 109.0, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 404.4, "text": "Iam pàstor in umbrà arbor- iacet. Arbor pàstór- et can- et"}, {"y0": 123.4, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 404.7, "text": "ov- umbram dat, sed ov- nigra in sól- iacet. Nüllae nüb-"}, {"y0": 137.4, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 404.4, "text": "ante sol- sunt. In silvà multae arbor- sunt, sub arbor- umbra"}, {"y0": 151.5, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 404.7, "text": "est. Ov- nigra à pàstor- céterisque ov- discédit. Canis ov-"}, {"y0": 165.0, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 172.5, "text": "videt."}, {"y0": 192.9, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 201.7, "text": "PENSVM B"}, {"y0": 206.9, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 404.6, "text": "Pastor et centum — in — sunt. Pastor ovibus aquam et —"}, {"y0": 221.1, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 404.0, "text": "dat. Cibus ovium est —, cibus pàástóris est —. Pastor pàánem"}, {"y0": 234.6, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 314.2, "text": "—. Oves herbam — et aquam — e —."}, {"y0": 248.5, "x0": 159.8, "x1": 404.2, "text": "Sol —, nülla — in caeló — hunc campum vidétur. In colle"}, {"y0": 262.4, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 404.0, "text": "üna — est, in — multae arbores sunt. — arboribus umbra"}, {"y0": 276.4, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 404.2, "text": "est. Pàstor ovés suas ad arborem —. — pàstor in — arboris"}, {"y0": 290.6, "x0": 149.1, "x1": 404.6, "text": "iacet, ovis nigra ceteras ovés — et silvam —. In terrà sunt —"}, {"y0": 304.3, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 403.8, "text": "lupi; lupus — nón procul abest. Lupus in silvà cibum —,"}, {"y0": 318.3, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 291.0, "text": "dum pástor et — ovem quaerunt."}, {"y0": 345.9, "x0": 149.1, "x1": 202.1, "text": "PENSVM C"}, {"y0": 359.9, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 285.8, "text": "Num páàstor solus in campo est?"}, {"y0": 373.8, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 251.6, "text": "Quot ovés habet pàstor?"}, {"y0": 386.4, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 264.5, "text": "À quó canis cibum accipit?"}, {"y0": 401.5, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 285.8, "text": "Suntne montés prope pàástórem?"}, {"y0": 415.5, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 217.0, "text": "Ubi sunt vallées?"}, {"y0": 429.2, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 214.3, "text": "Quid est collis?"}, {"y0": 443.4, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 209.4, "text": "Quó it pàstor?"}, {"y0": 457.5, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 259.8, "text": "Cür pàstor umbram petit?"}, {"y0": 471.3, "x0": 149.0, "x1": 225.1, "text": "Quó it ovis nigra?"}, {"y0": 484.8, "x0": 148.8, "x1": 253.2, "text": "Quid ovis in terrà videt?"}, {"y0": 498.9, "x0": 148.8, "x1": 288.8, "text": "Cür lupus ovem nigram nón est?"}], "margin": [{"y0": 70.1, "x0": 48.9, "x1": 99.7, "text": "Vocábula nova:"}, {"y0": 81.3, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 75.2, "text": "campus"}, {"y0": 88.8, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 70.0, "text": "pástor"}, {"y0": 97.1, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 65.8, "text": "canis"}, {"y0": 106.3, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 62.0, "text": "ovis"}, {"y0": 115.3, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 66.9, "text": "cibus"}, {"y0": 124.5, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 68.0, "text": "herba"}, {"y0": 134.4, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 65.8, "text": "rivus"}, {"y0": 143.0, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 66.7, "text": "pànis"}, {"y0": 152.6, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 67.3, "text": "mons"}, {"y0": 161.0, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 66.2, "text": "vallis"}, {"y0": 170.0, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 66.4, "text": "collis"}, {"y0": 179.0, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 67.3, "text": "arbor"}, {"y0": 187.8, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 64.0, "text": "silva"}, {"y0": 197.0, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 67.8, "text": "lupus"}, {"y0": 206.4, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 57.5, "text": "sól"}, {"y0": 215.7, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 73.2, "text": "caelum"}, {"y0": 226.4, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 64.6, "text": "terra"}, {"y0": 234.1, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 68.9, "text": "nübés"}, {"y0": 243.1, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 71.2, "text": "umbra"}, {"y0": 252.1, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 82.4, "text": "vestigium"}, {"y0": 260.7, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 67.4, "text": "timor"}, {"y0": 269.9, "x0